# DEVELOPER NOTES

## General Layout Guidelines:
- **Mobile-first responsive design** — 70%+ of traffic will be mobile
- **Sticky CTA button** on mobile (fixed bottom bar with "Jetzt bestellen" button)
- **Smooth scroll** to pricing section when CTA buttons are clicked
- **Lazy load** all images for performance
- **Countdown timer** should use JavaScript with a rolling 24h window
- **Testimonial cards** should auto-scroll horizontally on mobile
- **FAQ section** uses accordion pattern (one open at a time)
- **Marquee/ticker** for the scrolling offer bar — CSS animation, not JS

## Color Palette:
- Primary Background: `#FFF8F0` (warm cream)
- Secondary Background: `#FFFFFF` (white)
- Primary Accent: `#C4956A` (rose gold)
- Secondary Accent: `#6B2D5B` (deep burgundy)
- Gold Accent: `#D4A76A`
- Text Primary: `#2D2D2D` (near black)
- Text Secondary: `#6B6B6B` (warm grey)
- Success/Check: `#4A8C5C` (muted green)
- Error/X: `#C45B5B` (muted red)

## Typography:
- Headings: Playfair Display (serif) or similar elegant serif
- Body: DM Sans or Inter (clean sans-serif)
- Accent/Labels: Uppercase tracking for badges and labels

## Key Conversion Elements:
- Every section should have a CTA or link back to pricing
- Social proof should be visible on first scroll (hero testimonials)
- Urgency elements: countdown timer,
"letzte Charge" warning, stock indicators
- Trust signals repeated throughout: guarantee badge, lab-tested badge, star ratings